# Normalise to LF in the repository and in working copies.
#
# Without this, Git on Windows checks these files out as CRLF. The service
# worker caches the app shell under a hash of the built HTML (build-web.mjs),
# deliberately so that a rebuild changing nothing leaves the cache alone —
# line-ending drift between machines would defeat that and needlessly
# invalidate every installed copy.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.ico binary
